0faj egy\u00e9ni bejegyz\u00e9st\u00edpusok automatikusan beker\u00fclnek. A noindexre \u00e1ll\u00edtott tartalom mindig kimarad."],"Custom Taxonomies":["Egy\u00e9ni taxon\u00f3mi\u00e1k"],"Custom taxonomy archives are only listed when switched on here.":["Az egy\u00e9ni taxon\u00f3mia arch\u00edvumok csak akkor vannak list\u00e1zva, ha itt be van kapcsolva."],"Content Signals":["Tartalmi jelz\u00e9sek"],"Tell AI systems how they may use your content. Sent as a Content-Signal HTTP header, a meta tag and a robots.txt line. \"Not specified\" neither grants nor restricts that use.":["Mondd meg az AI rendszereknek, hogyan haszn\u00e1lhatj\u00e1k a tartalmadat. Content-Signal HTTP headerk\u00e9nt, meta tagk\u00e9nt \u00e9s egy robots.txt sorban ker\u00fcl elk\u00fcld\u00e9sre. A \"Nincs megadva\" sem nem enged\u00e9lyezi, sem nem korl\u00e1tozza ezt a haszn\u00e1latot."],"Search":["Keres\u00e9s"],"AI Input (RAG, grounding)":["AI bemenet (RAG, grounding)"],"llms.txt File":["llms.txt f\u00e1jl"],"Your llms.txt:":["A te llms.txt f\u00e1jlod:"],"Learn more":["Tudj meg t\u00f6bbet"],"llms.txt":["llms.txt"],"Enable llms.txt for AI crawlers":["Enged\u00e9lyezd az llms.txt-t AI crawler-ek sz\u00e1m\u00e1ra"],"One sentence shown as the summary line. Empty = the site tagline.":["Egy mondat, ami \u00f6sszefoglal\u00f3 sork\u00e9nt jelenik meg. \u00dcresen = a webhely jelmondata."],"Introduction":["Bevezet\u00e9s"],"Optional Markdown text shown before the page lists. Do not use headings.":["Opcion\u00e1lis Markdown sz\u00f6veg, ami az oldallist\u00e1k el\u0151tt jelenik meg. Ne haszn\u00e1lj c\u00edmsorokat."],"Content types":["Tartalomt\u00edpusok"],"Each type becomes its own section. Noindex content and content with AI Input set to \"No\" are left out.":["Minden t\u00edpus k\u00fcl\u00f6n szekci\u00f3 lesz. A noindex tartalom \u00e9s az \"AI bemenet\" mez\u0151n\u00e9l \"Nem\"-re \u00e1ll\u00edtott tartalom kimarad."],"Items per section":["Elemek szekci\u00f3nk\u00e9nt"],"Pages are listed in menu order, other types newest first.":["Az oldalak men\u00fcsorrendben, a t\u00f6bbi t\u00edpus a leg\u00fajabbal kezdve van list\u00e1zva."],"Markdown links":["Markdown hivatkoz\u00e1sok"],"Link to the Markdown version of each page (\/md)":["Link az oldalak Markdown v\u00e1ltozat\u00e1ra (\/md)"],"Link to the HTML page":["Link a HTML oldalra"],"Extra links":["Extra linkek"],"One per line: Title | https:\/\/url | optional description. Listed under \"Optional\".":["Soronk\u00e9nt egy: C\u00edm | https:\/\/url | opcion\u00e1lis le\u00edr\u00e1s. Az \"Optional\" szekci\u00f3ban jelennek meg."],"llms-full.txt":["llms-full.txt"],"Built as a logged-out visitor. Content-restriction plugins that only protect the main page query may not apply here; use the lw_seo_post_is_eligible filter to leave restricted posts out.":["Kijelentkezett l\u00e1togat\u00f3k\u00e9nt \u00e9p\u00fcl fel. Azok a tartalomkorl\u00e1toz\u00f3 b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9nyek, amelyek csak a f\u0151 oldallek\u00e9rdez\u00e9st v\u00e9dik, itt nem biztos, hogy \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes\u00fclnek; haszn\u00e1ld az lw_seo_post_is_eligible filtert, hogy a korl\u00e1tozott bejegyz\u00e9sek kimaradjanak."],"Also serve \/llms-full.txt with the full Markdown content (max 1 MB)":["Szolg\u00e1ld ki a \/llms-full.txt-t is a teljes Markdown tartalommal (max. 1 MB)"],"AI Crawler Access":["AI crawler hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9s"],"Blocked crawlers get a \"Disallow: \/\" rule in robots.txt.":["A tiltott crawlerek \"Disallow: \/\" szab\u00e1lyt kapnak a robots.txt-ben."],"All AI training crawlers":["Minden AI-tan\u00edt\u00f3 crawler"],"Covers every crawler with that purpose, including ones added in future updates.":["Lefedi az \u00f6sszes ilyen c\u00e9l\u00fa crawlert, bele\u00e9rtve a j\u00f6v\u0151beli friss\u00edt\u00e9sekben hozz\u00e1adottakat is."],"All AI search crawlers":["Minden AI-keres\u0151 crawler"],"All user-triggered AI fetchers":["Minden felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3 \u00e1ltal ind\u00edtott AI-lek\u00e9r\u0151"],"robots.txt is a request, not an enforcement. OpenAI, Perplexity, Meta and Amazon state that their user-triggered fetchers may ignore it.":["A robots.txt egy k\u00e9r\u00e9s, nem kik\u00e9nyszer\u00edt\u00e9s. Az OpenAI, a Perplexity, a Meta \u00e9s az Amazon szerint a felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3 \u00e1ltal ind\u00edtott lek\u00e9r\u0151ik figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagyhatj\u00e1k."],"Optimize your WooCommerce products for search engines and social media.":["Optimaliz\u00e1ld a WooCommerce term\u00e9keidet keres\u0151motorokhoz \u00e9s k\u00f6z\u00f6ss\u00e9gi m\u00e9di\u00e1hoz."],"Adds product-specific OpenGraph tags, Schema.org Product markup, and more.":["Term\u00e9kspecifikus OpenGraph tageket, Schema.org Product jel\u00f6l\u00e9st \u00e9s m\u00e9g sok m\u00e1st ad hozz\u00e1."],"Product Title":["Term\u00e9k c\u00edme"],"Shop Title":["Bolt c\u00edme"],"Title of the shop page (product archive). %%title%% is the shop page title.":["A bolt oldal (term\u00e9karch\u00edvum) c\u00edme. A %%title%% a bolt oldal c\u00edme."],"Products":["Term\u00e9kek"],"Add noindex to product pages.":["A term\u00e9koldalak kapjanak noindexet."],"Permalinks":["Permalinkek"],"Slug-only WooCommerce permalinks. Categories whose root slug collides with a page, reserved slug, or another taxonomy\/CPT base are automatically skipped to avoid breaking existing URLs.":["Csak slugot tartalmaz\u00f3 WooCommerce permalinkek. Azokat a kateg\u00f3ri\u00e1kat, amelyek f\u0151 slugja \u00fctk\u00f6zik egy oldallal, foglalt sluggal vagy m\u00e1sik taxon\u00f3mia\/CPT alappal, automatikusan kihagyjuk, hogy a megl\u00e9v\u0151 URL-ek ne t\u00f6rjenek el."],"Category base":["Kateg\u00f3ria b\u00e1zis"],"Remove \/product-category\/ from product category URLs":["A \/product-category\/ elt\u00e1vol\u00edt\u00e1sa a term\u00e9kkateg\u00f3ria URL-ekb\u0151l"],"Keep":["Megtart"],"Parent slugs":["Sz\u00fcl\u0151 slugok"],"Remove parent category slugs (leaf-only URLs)":["Sz\u00fcl\u0151kateg\u00f3ria-slugok elt\u00e