) \u00e1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1ssal."],"Redirect every 404 to the homepage":["Minden 404 \u00e1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1sa a kezd\u0151lapra"],"Features":["Funkci\u00f3k"],"Breadcrumbs":["Morzsamen\u00fc"],"Use shortcode [lw_breadcrumbs] or function lw_seo_breadcrumbs().":["Haszn\u00e1ld a [lw_breadcrumbs] shortcode-ot vagy az lw_seo_breadcrumbs() f\u00fcggv\u00e9nyt."],"Schema.org":["Schema.org"],"Output Schema.org JSON-LD":["Schema.org JSON-LD ki\u00edr\u00e1sa"],"robots.txt":["robots.txt"],"Add sitemap URL and AI rules to robots.txt":["Sitemap URL \u00e9s AI szab\u00e1lyok hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa a robots.txt-hez"],"Your robots.txt":["A robots.txt f\u00e1jlod"],"A physical robots.txt file exists (%s). The web server serves it directly, so these settings have no effect. Delete the file to let LW SEO manage robots.txt.":["L\u00e9tezik egy fizikai robots.txt f\u00e1jl (%s). A webszerver k\u00f6zvetlen\u00fcl azt szolg\u00e1lja ki, ez\u00e9rt ezek a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok nem hatnak. T\u00f6r\u00f6ld a f\u00e1jlt, hogy az LW SEO kezelhesse a robots.txt-t."],"Head Cleanup":["Head takar\u00edt\u00e1s"],"Shortlinks":["R\u00f6vid linkek"],"Removed from head":["Elt\u00e1vol\u00edtva a headb\u0151l"],"Kept":["Megtartva"],"RSD Link":["RSD link"],"WLW Manifest":["WLW manifest"],"Import SEO data from other SEO plugins. Existing LW SEO data will not be overwritten.":["SEO adatok import\u00e1l\u00e1sa m\u00e1s SEO b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9nyekb\u0151l. A megl\u00e9v\u0151 LW SEO adatok nem lesznek fel\u00fcl\u00edrva."],"Another SEO plugin (Yoast SEO, Rank Math or All in One SEO) is active. LW SEO skips its meta tags to avoid duplicates. Deactivate the other plugin to use LW SEO fully.":["Egy m\u00e1sik SEO b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9ny (Yoast SEO, Rank Math vagy All in One SEO) akt\u00edv. Az LW SEO kihagyja a meta tagjeit, hogy elker\u00fclje a duplik\u00e1ci\u00f3t. Kapcsold ki a m\u00e1sik b\u0151v\u00edtm\u00e9nyt az LW SEO teljes haszn\u00e1lat\u00e1hoz."]}}}